@startuml
title RuleSphere - Explain Historical Decisions and Inspect Audit\nUC-25..26
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #177E8D
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBackgroundColor #EAF6F8

actor "Authorized User / Compliance or Security Auditor" as User
boundary "Management API" as API
participant AuthorizationService as Auth
participant EvidenceQueryService as Query
database "Hot Trace Store" as Hot
database "Compliance Ledger" as Ledger
database "Governance / Deployment / Security Audit" as Audit

User -> API: Explain(executionId) / InspectAudit(filter)
activate API

API -> Auth: authorize(principal, evidence action, scope)
activate Auth
Auth --> API: Access decision
deactivate Auth

break Unauthorized scope
  API --> User: Access denied without disclosing evidence
end

API -> Query: Query within authorized Tenant/Workspace
activate Query

alt UC-25: Explain historical decision
  Query -> Hot: Find retained protected tree by scoped ExecutionID
  activate Hot
  Hot --> Query: Tree or not retained / not found
  deactivate Hot
  
  Query -> Ledger: Find scoped execution metadata
  activate Ledger
  Ledger --> Query: Metadata and approval/release reference or not found
  deactivate Ledger
  
  opt Accessible approval/release evidence reference exists
    Query -> Audit: Read referenced evidence within authorized scope
    activate Audit
    Audit --> Query: Governance / release evidence
    deactivate Audit
  end
  
  Query -> Query: Assemble available version, node, outcome and evidence details
  note right of Query
    After hot-trace expiry, return retained metadata
    with explicit full-tree unavailability.
    Never invent missing intermediate decisions.
  end note
else UC-26: Inspect audit evidence
  Query -> Audit: Read scoped governance / deployment / security records
  activate Audit
  Audit --> Query: Immutable attributable records
  deactivate Audit
end

Query -> Audit: Record evidence access actor, scope, query and timestamp
activate Audit
Audit --> Query: Logged
deactivate Audit

Query --> API: Authorized protected evidence / explicit unavailable result
deactivate Query

API --> User: Explanation / audit view or export
deactivate API

@enduml
